WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.902
YOU COULD TELL DEFINITELY

00:00:03.668 --> 00:00:04.736
GUNSHOTS.

00:00:04.035 --> 00:00:07.739
&gt;&gt; Bret: SOME OF THE STUDENTS

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:08.373
WHO HAD TO DEAL WITH A HORRIBLE

00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:09.207
SCENE.

00:00:08.506 --> 00:00:10.742
17 DEAD.

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:16.915
STEVE HELTON AS A FORMER ADVISOR

00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:17.649
TO DAVID CAMERON.

00:00:17.048 --> 00:00:18.583
MARA LIASSON, NATIONAL POLITICAL

00:00:17.782 --> 00:00:20.619
CORRESPONDENT FOR NATIONAL

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:21.019
PUBLIC RADIO AND MATTHEW

00:00:20.752 --> 00:00:24.789
CONTINUITY.

00:00:21.152 --> 00:00:26.725
WE HAVE SEEN SO MANY OF THESE.

00:00:24.923 --> 00:00:28.393
THERE IS SOMETHING OF A NUMBNESS

00:00:26.858 --> 00:00:31.964
WHEN YOU HEAR IT HAPPENS BUT

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:34.132
THEN WHEN YOU ARE HIT BY THE

00:00:32.097 --> 00:00:35.834
NUMBER, IT IS SHOCKING.

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:41.773
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU LISTEN TO THE KIDS

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:40.872
TALK ABOUT WHAT THEY SAW, I HAVE

00:00:40.872 --> 00:00:40.973
TALK ABOUT WHAT THEY SAW, I HAVI

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:41.006
TALK ABOUT WHAT THEY SAW, I HAVH

00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:41.039
TALK ABOUT WHAT THEY SAW, I HAVV

00:00:41.039 --> 00:00:42.541
TALK ABOUT WHAT THEY SAW, I HAVE

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:45.143
A MIDDLE SCHOOLER AND

00:00:42.674 --> 00:00:47.446
HIGH SCHOOLER.

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:49.414
IT'S -- THEY'RE BEEN 12 SCHOOL

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:53.919
SHOOTINGS IN 2018.

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:55.921
WE HAVE HAD 45 DAYS OF 2018.

00:00:54.052 --> 00:00:58.156
THIS HAPPENS TOO MUCH.

00:00:56.054 --> 00:01:02.528
&gt;&gt; Bret: GETTING TO STOPPING

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:03.529
THIS, STEVE, IS A CONUNDRUM.

00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:04.897
IT DOESN'T HAPPEN IN

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:05.264
GREAT BRITAIN THE FREQUENCY IT

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:07.199
HAS HERE.

00:01:05.397 --> 00:01:11.136
IT HAPPENS BUT IT DOESN'T HAPPEN

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:12.171
IN THESE NUMBERS.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.738
YOU HEARD SENATOR NELSON,

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:13.739
SENATOR RUBIO.

00:01:12.871 --> 00:01:15.341
WAIT FOR THE FACTS.

00:01:13.872 --> 00:01:16.675
SEE WHAT THE DEAL IS.

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:18.310
THERE'S A HUNGER TO TRY TO

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:19.945
FIGURE OUT HOW WE AS A COUNTRY

00:01:18.444 --> 00:01:23.749
ARE GOING TO TACKLE THIS.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:26.251
&gt;&gt; THERE IS.

00:01:23.882 --> 00:01:26.919
AS MARA WAS SAYING, IT'S REALLY

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:27.720
HARD TO TAKE.

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:30.789
NO CHILD SHOULD HAVE TO SEE

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:32.958
THINGS LIKE THAT AND HAVE TO

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:33.325
RECOUNT THEM IN THE WAY WE JUST

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:35.094
HEARD.

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:35.794
OF COURSE THERE IS A NATURAL

00:01:35.227 --> 00:01:37.029
HUMAN REACTION WHICH IS TO SAY

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:37.296
THERE MUST BE SOMETHING WE CAN

00:01:37.162 --> 00:01:41.233
DO.

00:01:37.429 --> 00:01:44.803
THERE MUST BE SOME POLICY OF

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:45.137
SOME KIND AND MAKE THIS NOT

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:47.740
HAPPEN.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:49.742
THE BRITISH PERSPECTIVE FOR ME

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:51.644
IS, HAVING BEEN HERE SIX YEARS

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:53.379
IN AMERICA, AND LIVED HERE AND

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:56.148
UNDERSTOOD THINGS I DIDN'T

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:57.750
UNDERSTAND WHEN I LIVED IN THE

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.751
U.K., YES, IT'S TRUE THAT IN

00:01:57.883 --> 00:02:01.153
COUNTRIES LIKE THE U.K. THEY

00:01:58.884 --> 00:02:02.388
LOOK AT THIS AND SAY WHAT'S THE

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:04.357
MATTER WITH THEM?

00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:07.193
WHY DOES THIS KEEP HAPPENING?

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:08.494
WHY CAN'T THEY SORT IT OUT?

00:02:07.326 --> 00:02:10.863
NOW THAT I'M HERE, I UNDERSTAND

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:12.999
IT'S NOT AS SIMPLE AS THAT.

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:14.133
THERE'S A HERITAGE AND CULTURE

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:15.735
AND HISTORY HERE.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:17.536
SOME SOLUTIONS THAT MAY SEEM

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.738
OBVIOUS IN OTHER COUNTRIES ARE

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.538
NOT OBVIOUS HERE.

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:23.743
IT'S IMPORTANT TO POINT OUT WHEN

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:24.777
WE SEE SOMETHING LIKE THIS,

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:25.778
FOCUSING ALL OF OUR ATTENTION,

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:28.147
THESE MASS SHOOTINGS.

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:29.115
MOST OF THE PEOPLE WHO DIED FROM

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:32.351
GUN VIOLENCE IN AMERICA DON'T

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:33.753
DIE IN THESE SITUATIONS.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:34.153
THEY DIED ONCE AND NEVER GET

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:37.056
ATTENTION.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:38.457
I THINK THE IDEA THAT THERE IS A

00:02:37.189 --> 00:02:38.991
SIMPLE SOLUTION IS JUST NOT

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:41.727
TRUE.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:42.461
&gt;&gt; Bret: FOR EXAMPLE, THE

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:44.363
NUMBERS OUT OF CHICAGO DAY TODAY

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:46.933
ARE STAGGERING.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.767
WE COVER THEM HERE BUT IN THIS

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:50.536
SITUATION, THESE MASS SCHOOL

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.938
SHOOTINGS, IT DOES NOT APPEAR

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.339
THIS GUY HAS A TERRORIST TIE.

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.974
WE DON'T KNOW.

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.842
HE'S BEEN EXPELLED FOR

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:57.677
DISCIPLINARY ACTION, SEEMED LIKE

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:59.979
A TROUBLED STUDENT WHO WAS

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.747
TALKING ABOUT GUNS AND BOMBS

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:03.149
BEFORE.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:06.920
&gt;&gt; HE WAS BORN IN 1998, A FEW

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:08.121
MONTHS BEFORE COLUMBINE.

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:11.357
REALLY KIND OF INAUGURATED THIS

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:11.724
HISTORICAL EPIC OF SCHOOL

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:14.427
SHOOTINGS.

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:15.862
WE ARE COMING UP ALMOST ON THE

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:16.996
20TH ANNIVERSARY OF COLUMBINE IN

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.797
1999.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.133
IT'S BEEN A GENERATION.

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:22.936
YOU SEE THE PREPARATION THAT

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:23.603
GOES INTO NOT ONLY THE

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:24.137
AUTHORITIES BUT ALMOST THE

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:26.139
STUDENTS.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.574
THE WAY THEY WERE DESCRIBING

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.775
THEIR EXPERIENCE.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:29.743
SOME WERE CLEARLY EMOTIONALLY

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:30.577
RATTLED.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:31.711
OTHERS WERE DESCRIBING IT

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.946
BECAUSE THEY ARE KIND OF USED TO

00:03:31.845 --> 00:03:35.749
THE PROCEDURES.

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:37.951
IT'S BECOME KIND OF A WAY OF

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:39.386
LIFE WHICH I DON'T THINK ANYONE

00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:39.753
COUNTED ON WHEN COLUMBINE

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:44.591
HAPPENED.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:46.426
ANOTHER X FACTOR'S SOCIAL MEDIA.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:48.562
WHEN COLUMBINE HAPPENED, WE HAD

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:50.163
CABLE NEWS AND 24-HOUR COVERAGE.

00:03:48.695 --> 00:03:51.164
NOW WE HAVE REAL-TIME ACCOUNTS

00:03:50.297 --> 00:03:53.366
FROM STUDENTS THEMSELVES.

00:03:51.298 --> 00:03:54.201
ON THE ONE HAND, THAT GIVES US A

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.568
PERSPECTIVE ABOUT WHAT

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:57.304
HAPPENING.

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:58.972
ON THE OTHER IT MEANS SOMETIMES

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.339
MISINFORMATION AND RUMOR CAN GET

00:03:59.106 --> 00:04:01.975
INVOLVED.

00:03:59.473 --> 00:04:04.144
WE ARE LIVING IN THIS ERA BUT

00:04:02.109 --> 00:04:06.346
THERE HAVE BEEN NEW CHANGES I

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:07.547
THINK THAT MAKE IT ALL THE MORE

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.882
VISCERAL TO US.

00:04:07.681 --> 00:04:09.950
&gt;&gt; Bret: OUR JOB IS TO COVER

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:12.352
IT.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:17.357
WE DON'T WANT TO MAKE THIS GUY A

00:04:12.486 --> 00:04:20.127
STAR, BUT THIS IS A MAJOR EVENT

00:04:17.491 --> 00:04:21.361
IN U.S. NEWS AT THIS MOMENT AND

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.130
FRANKLY THIS YEAR.

00:04:21.495 --> 00:04:24.865
MARA, WHAT DO YOU THINK, AS WE

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:26.466
DO THIS EVERY TIME, WHAT DO YOU

00:04:24.998 --> 00:04:27.934
THINK COMES OUT OF THIS?

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:30.437
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE HAVE CERTAINLY

00:04:28.068 --> 00:04:31.271
LEARNED NOT TO PREDICT ANY KIND

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:33.740
OF LEGISLATIVE SOLUTION IS GOING

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:36.343
TO COME OUT OF THIS.

00:04:33.874 --> 00:04:38.345
IT DIDN'T COME OUT OF NEWTOWN

00:04:36.477 --> 00:04:38.779
WHERE SEVERAL DOZEN KIDS WERE

00:04:38.479 --> 00:04:40.314
GUNNED DOWN.

00:04:38.912 --> 00:04:41.448
I DON'T THINK THERE'S A SIMPLE

00:04:40.447 --> 00:04:45.352
SOLUTION BUT I THINK THERE ARE

00:04:41.582 --> 00:04:46.787
SOME THINGS YOU COULD DO TO MAKE

00:04:45.486 --> 00:04:48.355
THESE LESS FREQUENT.

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:49.590
TO MAKE GUN DEATHS IN GENERAL

00:04:48.489 --> 00:04:53.761
LESS FREQUENT.

00:04:49.723 --> 00:04:55.296
WHY DO PEOPLE ON A TERRORIST

00:04:53.894 --> 00:04:56.731
WATCH LIST STILL ALLOWED TO BUY

00:04:55.429 --> 00:04:57.465
GUNS.

00:04:56.864 --> 00:05:00.000
ISN'T THERE A BETTER SYSTEM FOR

00:04:57.598 --> 00:05:02.002
FLAGGING MENTAL HEALTH PROBLEMS?

00:05:00.134 --> 00:05:04.038
I DON'T KNOW WHAT THEY WOULD BE

00:05:02.136 --> 00:05:06.006
BUT IT SEEMS THERE ARE SOME

00:05:04.171 --> 00:05:07.575
SIMPLE THINGS, MAYBE NOT WAVE A

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:09.577
MAGIC WAND, BUT THIS SHOULDN'T

00:05:07.708 --> 00:05:11.946
HAPPEN THIS OFTEN PERIOD.

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:14.749
I DON'T CARE IF WE LIVE IN A

00:05:12.079 --> 00:05:15.449
COUNTRY THAT HAS A STRONG, PROUD

00:05:14.882 --> 00:05:18.486
HERITAGE OF OWNING FIREARMS.

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:18.085
THIS SHOULDN'T HAPPEN THIS OFTEN

00:05:18.085 --> 00:05:18.953
THIS SHOULDN'T HAPPEN THIS OFTE

00:05:18.619 --> 00:05:20.955
OFTEN.

00:05:19.086 --> 00:05:21.389
&gt;&gt; Bret: THAT WE CAN SAY

00:05:21.088 --> 00:05:22.623
DEFINITIVELY.

00:05:21.522 --> 00:05:27.595
&gt;&gt; THERE MUST BE WAYS WE CAN

00:05:22.757 --> 00:05:28.329
MAKE IT LESS HAPPEN LESS

00:05:27.728 --> 00:05:30.164
FREQUENTLY.

00:05:28.462 --> 00:05:31.565
&gt;&gt; Bret: THERE ARE 535

00:05:30.297 --> 00:05:32.366
LAWMAKERS BEHIND ME IN THAT

00:05:31.699 --> 00:05:34.502
BUILDING.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.369
WE'VE HAD A LOT OF TIME OVER THE

00:05:34.635 --> 00:05:37.571
YEARS.

00:05:35.503 --> 00:05:41.175
WHY DO YOU THINK -- IT DOESN'T

00:05:37.705 --> 00:05:42.476
HAVE TO BE A GUN POLICY ISSUE?

00:05:41.308 --> 00:05:43.477
COULDN'T BE A MENTAL HEALTH

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.546
ISSUE?

00:05:43.611 --> 00:05:47.281
&gt;&gt; AND WE HAVE THESE DISCUSSIONS

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.382
AFTER THESE HORRIFIC EVENTS,

00:05:47.415 --> 00:05:48.816
THAT PHRASE COMES UP A LOT.

00:05:48.516 --> 00:05:51.118
MENTAL HEALTH.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.588
I THINK WE NEED TO GO DEEPER

00:05:51.252 --> 00:05:54.288
THAN THAT BECAUSE THERE'S A

00:05:53.721 --> 00:05:55.122
SENSE OF SOCIAL BREAKDOWN NOT

00:05:54.422 --> 00:05:56.657
JUST IN AMERICA.

00:05:55.256 --> 00:05:58.226
I DON'T WANT TO MAKE IT AMERICAN

00:05:56.791 --> 00:05:59.360
BUT YOU SEE IT IN COUNTRIES, WE

00:05:58.359 --> 00:06:00.828
SOUGHT IN THE U.K. WHEN I WORKED

00:05:59.494 --> 00:06:01.996
IN GOVERNMENT THERE AND IT WAS

00:06:00.962 --> 00:06:03.664
ONE OF THE THINGS WE TRIED TO

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:09.237
ADDRESS AND IT COMES BACK TO

00:06:03.798 --> 00:06:10.204
THINGS LIKE THE DISINTEGRATION

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:10.972
OF THE FAMILY.

00:06:10.338 --> 00:06:13.374
PEOPLE NOT GROWING UP IN STABLE,

00:06:11.105 --> 00:06:15.276
LOVING HOMES.

00:06:13.508 --> 00:06:17.779
ALL THE OTHER ISSUES WE DEAL

00:06:15.409 --> 00:06:20.348
WITH PIECEMEAL.

00:06:17.912 --> 00:06:21.048
THEY GO BACK TO THAT NOTION OF

00:06:20.481 --> 00:06:24.952
STABILITY IN THE FAMILY HOME,

00:06:21.182 --> 00:06:25.787
AND THAT IS SOMETHING GOVERNMENT

00:06:25.086 --> 00:06:29.457
CAN HELP ADDRESS.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:31.559
I DON'T SEE ANY SIGN OF THE KIND

00:06:29.591 --> 00:06:33.294
OF FOCUS WE NEED ON HELPING MAKE

00:06:31.693 --> 00:06:35.897
SURE EVERY CHILD IN THIS COUNTRY

00:06:33.428 --> 00:06:36.197
GROWS UP IN A STABLE, LOVING

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:36.898
HOME.

00:06:36.331 --> 00:06:38.766
THAT CERTAINLY WOULD HELP WITH

00:06:37.031 --> 00:06:40.668
THIS.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:42.003
&gt;&gt; Bret: IN THE SHORT-TERM

00:06:40.802 --> 00:06:44.038
TONIGHT WE ALL GRIEVE FOR 17

00:06:42.136 --> 00:06:44.606
FAMILIES WHO WILL NOT HAVE THEIR

00:06:44.172 --> 00:06:46.174
KIDS COMING HOME.

00:06:44.739 --> 00:06:48.242
WE DON'T KNOW IF THEY ARE ALL

00:06:46.307 --> 00:06:49.844
KIDS OR TEACHERS AND KIDS BUT 17

00:06:48.376 --> 00:06:52.046
FAMILIES WILL NOT HAVE LOVED

00:06:49.978 --> 00:06:54.916
ONES COMING HOME TONIGHT.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:57.285
AND THAT IS STUNNING.

00:06:55.049 --> 00:06:58.987
&gt;&gt; ONE OF THE THINGS WE'VE SEEN

00:06:57.418 --> 00:07:00.088
AFTER THESE EVENTS IF YOU PLOT

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:02.256
LEGISLATION PASSED ON THE STATE

00:07:00.221 --> 00:07:03.391
LEVEL AND ELSEWHERE, WHAT

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:04.392
HAPPENS IS GUN LAWS GET

00:07:03.524 --> 00:07:06.528
LOOSENED.

00:07:04.525 --> 00:07:09.197
IT GETS EASIER TO BUY GUNS,

00:07:06.661 --> 00:07:12.667
EASIER TO CARRY THEM OPENLY.

00:07:09.331 --> 00:07:14.970
&gt;&gt; Bret: THE ARGUMENT IS IF IT

00:07:12.801 --> 00:07:15.570
WAS A SECURITY OFFICER WITH THE

00:07:15.103 --> 00:07:16.505
GUN, COULD'VE STOPPED.

00:07:15.704 --> 00:07:18.373
IT'S AN ARGUMENT.

00:07:16.638 --> 00:07:19.775
&gt;&gt; THOSE ARE THE KINDS OF

00:07:18.507 --> 00:07:20.175
LEGISLATION THAT'S BEEN PASSED.

00:07:19.908 --> 00:07:21.777
WHY?

00:07:20.308 --> 00:07:23.779
ONE OF THE REASONS AND YOU CAN'T

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:25.847
IGNORE IT IS THERE IS AN

00:07:23.912 --> 00:07:28.183
EXTERNALLY POWERFUL LOBBY IN

00:07:25.981 --> 00:07:29.184
THIS COUNTRY THAT DOESN'T WANT

00:07:28.316 --> 00:07:32.020
ANY OF THESE LAWS PASSED.

00:07:29.317 --> 00:07:33.955
&gt;&gt; A LOBBY THAT IS VERY

00:07:32.154 --> 00:07:36.358
EFFECTIVE AT ELECTING

00:07:34.089 --> 00:07:38.126
REPRESENTATIVES.

00:07:36.491 --> 00:07:38.794
MAINLY BECAUSE IT ENJOYS PUBLIC

00:07:38.260 --> 00:07:40.862
SUPPORT.

00:07:38.927 --> 00:07:42.898
ONE OF THE PARADOXES OF THE

00:07:40.996 --> 00:07:50.372
COLUMBINE ERA IS THAT EVEN AS WE

00:07:43.031 --> 00:07:51.073
SEE THESE HIGHLY NOTED,

00:07:50.505 --> 00:07:52.374
SENSATIONAL, MASS EVENTS THAT

00:07:51.206 --> 00:07:57.279
ARE HORRIFYING, THE POLITICS OF

00:07:52.507 --> 00:07:58.413
GUN CONTROL HAVE SHIFTED RIGHT.

00:07:57.412 --> 00:08:01.149
IT AND SO HOW ONE ADDRESSES THE

00:07:58.547 --> 00:08:02.784
SITUATION IS A MYSTERY.

00:08:01.283 --> 00:08:03.585
IT'S NOT JUST GUN-CONTROL.

00:08:02.918 --> 00:08:07.356
ITS PRIVACY CONCERNS CONCERNS.

00:08:03.719 --> 00:08:08.590
THE SHERIFF MENTIONED "SEE

00:08:07.489 --> 00:08:09.758
SOMETHING, SAY SOMETHING."

00:08:08.724 --> 00:08:11.793
LOOK AT SOCIAL MEDIA.

00:08:09.892 --> 00:08:12.794
I AM SURE THAT THE WIZARDS OF

00:08:11.927 --> 00:08:13.996
SILICON VALLEY EVENTUALLY WILL

00:08:12.928 --> 00:08:15.364
DEVELOP A PROGRAM THAT WILL BE

00:08:14.129 --> 00:08:17.366
ABLE TO APPEAL THROUGH SOCIAL

00:08:15.497 --> 00:08:18.634
MEDIA AND DETERMINE WHO IS MOST

00:08:17.499 --> 00:08:20.569
LIKELY TO COMMIT CRIMES SUCH AS

00:08:18.767 --> 00:08:22.804
THIS.

00:08:20.702 --> 00:08:24.072
&gt;&gt; Bret: WE RUN INTO PRIVACY

00:08:22.938 --> 00:08:25.207
CONCERNS FROM PEOPLE WHO SAY

00:08:24.206 --> 00:08:27.343
THIS IS BIG BROTHER LOOKING INTO

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:29.979
MY LIFE.

00:08:27.476 --> 00:08:32.181
&gt;&gt; THE CULTURE MAKES IT HARD FOR

00:08:30.112 --> 00:08:32.581
US TO ADDRESS THESE PROBLEMS

00:08:32.314 --> 00:08:35.618
POLITICALLY.

00:08:32.715 --> 00:08:38.754
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS A TIME WHEN CERTAIN

00:08:35.751 --> 00:08:39.888
KINDS OF SEMIAUTOMATIC WEAPONS

00:08:38.887 --> 00:08:43.592
WERE BANNED IN THIS COUNTRY.

00:08:40.022 --> 00:08:46.028
THAT BAN EXPIRED AND IT'S BEEN

00:08:43.726 --> 00:08:46.762
IMPOSSIBLE TO REINSTATE IT.

00:08:46.161 --> 00:08:47.963
NONE OF THESE SHOOTINGS WOULD

00:08:46.895 --> 00:08:49.798
HAVE A NUMBER OF FATALITIES.

00:08:48.097 --> 00:08:50.532
SOME PEOPLE WOULD BE KILLED.

00:08:49.932 --> 00:08:51.967
NOT AS MANY.

00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:54.970
&gt;&gt; Bret: HOLD ON.

00:08:52.101 --> 00:08:54.637
LET'S STAY CLEAR TO WHAT WE KNOW

00:08:54.637 --> 00:08:55.738
LET'S STAY CLEAR TO WHAT WE KNO

00:08:55.104 --> 00:08:56.772
KNOW.

00:08:55.871 --> 00:08:59.341
HE HAD AN AR-15.

00:08:56.905 --> 00:08:59.608
WE DON'T KNOW WHERE HE GOT THE

00:08:59.475 --> 00:09:02.178
GUN.

00:08:59.742 --> 00:09:03.279
PEOPLE SAY IF HE DIDN'T HAVE THE

00:09:02.311 --> 00:09:05.347
GUN, HE WOULD HAVE A BOMB AND HE

00:09:03.412 --> 00:09:07.883
WOULD PLANT THE BOMB.

00:09:05.481 --> 00:09:08.651
&gt;&gt; WE HAVEN'T HAD A LOT OF

00:09:08.017 --> 00:09:10.252
SCHOOL BOMBINGS.

00:09:08.784 --> 00:09:10.586
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU KNOW WHAT I AM

00:09:10.386 --> 00:09:12.588
SAYING.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:13.289
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT TALKING ABOUT THIS

00:09:12.722 --> 00:09:15.558
PARTICULAR INSTANCE BUT THERE

00:09:13.422 --> 00:09:16.025
WAS A TIME WHEN WE BANNED

00:09:15.691 --> 00:09:18.427
ASSAULT WEAPONS.

00:09:16.158 --> 00:09:22.798
&gt;&gt; Bret: LAST WORD, STEVE.

00:09:18.561 --> 00:09:24.433
&gt;&gt; I THINK THERE IS SOMETHING

00:09:22.932 --> 00:09:26.569
THAT CAN BE DONE BUT IT HAS TO

00:09:24.567 --> 00:09:27.537
BE DEEP AND LONG TERM AND

00:09:26.703 --> 00:09:28.771
ADDRESS THE SOCIAL CAUSES, NOT

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:32.075
JUST THE SYMPTOMS.

00:09:28.905 --> 00:09:33.343
IF THIS TOWN GOES ALL IN FOR

00:09:32.208 --> 00:09:36.546
TRYING TO FIND A GUN RELATED

00:09:33.476 --> 00:09:36.980
SOLUTION TO THIS, IT'S NOT GOING

00:09:36.679 --> 00:09:37.714
TO HAPPEN.

00:09:37.113 --> 00:09:42.051
SOMETHING USEFUL THAT COULD COME

00:09:37.847 --> 00:09:43.152
OUT OF IT IS REAL ACTION AROUND

